-- Adds new RFID tags to their matching ingredients.
-- Run this AFTER your main recipe.sqlite3-query has already created
-- the tables (station, ingredients, food, RFIDTags, etc).
--
-- Japanese-name mapping used below (matches your existing ingredients table):
--   Gohan   -> Rice
--   Jagaimo -> Potato
